    <briefdescription>
<para>Packed cursor state for atomic screen state transfer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Aggregates cursor position, visibility, and keyboard flags for one screen. <ref refid="structterminal_1_1_cursor_state_1aea059eba9f1a5b49c2d1756219e402c6" kindref="member">pack()</ref>/unpack() mirror <ref refid="structjam_1_1_cell_1_1_rectangle_1a0810396cf7587883701dca59edb2e402" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::Cell::Rectangle::pack()</ref>/unpack() in naming convention — 12 bits each for row/col, 1 for visible, 5 for kbFlags. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
